+Subject: [PATCH] ipq806x: backport stmmac UDP checksum fixes
+
+Backport fixes for stmmac which fixes packet drop on invalid UDP
+checksums.
+
+Link: https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20261114133640.3285413-2-opensource@grische.xyz/
+
+Signed-off-by: David Bauer <mail@david-bauer.net>
+---
+ ...r-Rx-checksum-errors-in-the-AF_XDP-z.patch | 66 ++++++++++++++++
+ ...1000-don-t-discard-frames-with-only-.patch | 76 +++++++++++++++++++
+ 2 files changed, 142 insertions(+)
